cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below, together with the associated paper."
type: software
title: "Code and data for: Designing Harvest Control Rules for Jack Mackerel using Stochastic Optimization in Policy Space"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/rlicandeo/sops-jack-mackerel"
abstract: >-
  Age-structured management strategy evaluation (MSE) for jack mackerel
  (Trachurus murphyi) of the South Pacific Regional Fisheries Management
  Organisation (SPRFMO). Stochastic Optimization in Policy Space (SOPS) is
  applied through a grid search over a linear harvest control rule, which is
  compared with traditional harvest control rules under three operating models.
  Includes the input data (from the JJM stock assessment), the scripts that
  reproduce all results, tables and figures of the paper and its Appendix, and
  the exact package versions (renv).
keywords:
  - management strategy evaluation
  - harvest control rules
  - stochastic optimization in policy space
  - jack mackerel
  - Trachurus murphyi
  - SPRFMO
  - R
